WEBVTT

00:00:02.580 --> 00:00:05.000
I think we guardian knights of the Book of Darkness

00:00:06.260 --> 00:00:14.940
were just weapons,
like the Relics or the Cradle<i> in the sky.</i>

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:22.540
Hayate gave us a reason to live,
and we’ve spent our time together atoning for our sins.

00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:25.600
Before we knew it, ten years had passed,

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:29.520
and now there are many more things that matter to us:

00:00:29.520 --> 00:00:34.180
Hayate, our friends, and our students.

00:00:34.180 --> 00:00:37.120
We have things we must protect.

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:38.820
And so...

00:00:38.820 --> 00:00:41.040
We’ll fight.

00:01:00.810 --> 00:01:06.960
The things that I can do for you and no one else

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:12.660
I honestly feel and wish for those

00:01:12.660 --> 00:01:19.380
I am frozen by uncertainties

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:25.620
By the rules I have been relying on

00:01:25.620 --> 00:01:31.320
My past embellished with excuses

00:01:31.320 --> 00:01:35.520
I want to get over it

00:01:35.520 --> 00:01:38.800
Staining the stars in heaven scarlet

00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:42.270
Gather the grains of miracles

00:01:42.270 --> 00:01:45.530
Before the still, unseen night

00:01:45.530 --> 00:01:48.810
I want to tell you that I am escaping from illusions

00:01:48.810 --> 00:01:51.990
The twilight moon calls out to me

00:01:51.990 --> 00:01:55.080
Removing my veil of delusions

00:01:55.080 --> 00:01:58.290
My hidden, deceitful self

00:01:58.290 --> 00:02:02.170
And took all of my weaknesses

00:02:02.170 --> 00:02:08.630
I don’t want words that seem passionate

00:02:08.630 --> 00:02:18.050
The fact that I’m here right now is my truth

00:02:30.690 --> 00:02:35.800
Fleets 1 and 2 will reach orbit over Mid in three hours.

00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:38.380
Their first priority is to create a defensive field over the city.

00:02:39.530 --> 00:02:43.680
Three and a half hours until
the counterattack fleet is in position.

00:02:46.090 --> 00:02:50.690
Yes. The Fleet Operations and
Communications Departments are in an uproar.

00:02:50.690 --> 00:02:55.300
But Advisor Leone is handling the upper ranks

00:02:55.300 --> 00:02:59.270
while Laty and her group take good care of the Operations Department.

00:02:59.270 --> 00:03:01.650
I doubt it will delay the operation.

00:03:01.650 --> 00:03:02.660
That really helps.

00:03:02.660 --> 00:03:04.580
Yuuno, how are things there?

00:03:04.580 --> 00:03:11.660
Data on the <i>Holy King’s Cradle</i> is scarce,
but I’ve finished digging up what little there is.

00:03:11.660 --> 00:03:12.630
I’ll send it now.

00:03:12.630 --> 00:03:17.040
Thanks. I’ll send it to
all the front-liners and the fleet from here.

00:03:17.040 --> 00:03:17.050
How dangerous is that ship?
Thanks. I’ll send it to
all the front-liners and the fleet from here.

00:03:17.050 --> 00:03:19.590
How dangerous is that ship?

00:03:20.160 --> 00:03:21.510
Extremely.

00:03:22.250 --> 00:03:27.550
Even in the Warrior Age of Ancient Belka,
it was treated as an ancient weapon and a Lost Logia.

00:03:27.550 --> 00:03:31.980
Some say it’s a relic from the lost world of Alhazred.

00:03:32.800 --> 00:03:34.400
Alhazred.

00:03:34.400 --> 00:03:38.860
To my family, that’s not a name we really want to remember.

00:03:38.860 --> 00:03:41.280
Fate...

00:03:43.470 --> 00:03:45.600
Regardless of that fact,

00:03:45.600 --> 00:03:49.450
the biggest threat is if it reaches orbit.

00:03:49.450 --> 00:03:54.250
By taking an orbital position where it can absorb mana from the two moons,

00:03:54.250 --> 00:03:56.950
its defensive capabilities improve considerably,

00:03:56.950 --> 00:04:01.930
and it will be able to launch precise strikes and magical bombs against the surface.

00:04:01.930 --> 00:04:04.340
The Church’s documents record this.

00:04:04.340 --> 00:04:06.580
Though according to my research,

00:04:06.580 --> 00:04:11.020
it will also be capable of transdimensionial attacks
and even combat in the Dimensional Sea.

00:04:11.970 --> 00:04:19.910
If it unleashes its full power,
it may be a match even for the Dimensional Navy.

00:04:19.910 --> 00:04:23.070
We need to stop it before it reaches orbit, is that right?

00:04:23.070 --> 00:04:25.490
Is there any way to deal with it?

00:04:25.490 --> 00:04:31.020
If its key, the Holy King, orders it to stop, or its engine is destroyed from inside.

00:04:32.360 --> 00:04:38.250
There’s a high probability the key, the Holy King, Vivio, is being controlled by Scaglietti’s combat cyborgs.

00:04:38.250 --> 00:04:42.250
So capturing Scaglietti would take care of it as well, right?

00:04:42.250 --> 00:04:44.740
Mom, Chrono.

00:04:45.430 --> 00:04:49.100
Fate will capture Scaglietti.

00:04:49.100 --> 00:04:49.890
Arf.

00:04:49.890 --> 00:04:54.960
Fate has been chasing after him for so long.

00:04:54.960 --> 00:04:57.860
I’m sure she’ll capture him.

00:05:08.270 --> 00:05:09.650
Defensive formation!

00:05:09.650 --> 00:05:11.650
Don’t break formation!

00:05:11.650 --> 00:05:13.060
Y-Yes, ma’am!

00:05:14.020 --> 00:05:16.500
It’s immense.

00:05:17.900 --> 00:05:22.460
No number of mages will be able to take it out from outside.

00:05:25.040 --> 00:05:28.160
Small units have appeared from Launch Chute 24!

00:05:28.160 --> 00:05:29.800
From the south too?

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:30.720
Nine hundred!

00:05:30.720 --> 00:05:31.970
They’re heading straight for the city!

00:05:31.970 --> 00:05:34.180
Everyone, calm down!

00:05:34.180 --> 00:05:36.260
If they split up, we’ll never be able to deal with them.

00:05:36.260 --> 00:05:41.360
We’ll take out all the units and cannons that we can.

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:44.180
Midchildan ground and aerial mages,

00:05:44.180 --> 00:05:46.340
time to show us what you’re made of!

00:05:46.340 --> 00:05:47.800
Yes, ma’am!

00:05:50.930 --> 00:05:51.780
Capt. Takamachi!

00:05:52.280 --> 00:05:54.750
We’ve found what we think is a way in!

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:57.920
Twenty members of the Assault Team have gone on ahead!

00:05:57.920 --> 00:05:59.150
Hayate.

00:05:59.150 --> 00:06:02.340
I’ll take care of the outside.

00:06:02.340 --> 00:06:05.280
Nanoha, Vita, will you go?

00:06:05.280 --> 00:06:06.260
Of course!

00:06:06.260 --> 00:06:07.260
Roger!

00:06:13.220 --> 00:06:18.390
Stars 1 and 2 of Riot Force 6
have entered the inner corridor.

00:06:21.680 --> 00:06:23.260
An A.M.F.?

00:06:23.260 --> 00:06:24.980
All throughout the corridor?

00:06:37.370 --> 00:06:39.170
<b>Gale Burst</b>

00:06:40.580 --> 00:06:43.150
Cut them down, Windenschaft!

00:07:07.550 --> 00:07:09.380
The other squad has found a passage.

00:07:09.380 --> 00:07:11.910
We will immediately seal any dangerous objects.

00:07:11.910 --> 00:07:13.240
Roger.

00:07:13.240 --> 00:07:16.960
Handle all assault routes as instructed by Inspector Acous.

00:07:16.960 --> 00:07:17.830
Yes, ma’am.

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:20.780
Thank you very much, Sister Schach.

00:07:20.780 --> 00:07:23.750
Thanks to your investigation,
we can go on ahead without getting lost.

00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:26.110
Investigation is his specialty.

00:07:26.110 --> 00:07:29.380
These dogs did their best.

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:33.300
Let’s keep going until we get to Scaglietti.

00:07:33.300 --> 00:07:34.780
Yes.

00:07:41.100 --> 00:07:42.550
I’m sorry, everyone.

00:07:42.550 --> 00:07:45.170
It’s gonna get bumpy, so hang on!

00:07:58.540 --> 00:08:00.200
Okay, I got rid of them!

00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:02.420
Amazing, Alto!

00:08:02.420 --> 00:08:03.870
Thanks, Subaru.

00:08:03.870 --> 00:08:06.340
Hey, we’re almost at the drop point.

00:08:06.340 --> 00:08:08.200
Are you ready, everyone?

00:08:08.200 --> 00:08:09.040
Yes!

00:08:11.570 --> 00:08:12.880
I’ll outline our mission.

00:08:12.880 --> 00:08:19.420
We’re going to join up with the counterattacking front
in the city in Central Mid.

00:08:19.420 --> 00:08:28.360
We’ll work together with the G.A.S. and take care of the more annoying forces, the summoner, and combat cyborgs.

00:08:28.360 --> 00:08:34.440
Very few of the other squads have anti-A.M.F. or cyborg combat experience.

00:08:34.440 --> 00:08:39.180
So we’ll hit them at the top and just take down as much of their combat power as we can.

00:08:39.180 --> 00:08:43.990
The rest of them will be handled by the counterattacking front, right?

00:08:43.990 --> 00:08:44.770
Right.

00:08:44.770 --> 00:08:47.080
But somehow,

00:08:47.080 --> 00:08:50.670
I kind of feel like an ace.

00:08:51.620 --> 00:08:52.590
That’s right.

00:08:52.590 --> 00:08:57.170
If the Gadgets and the combat cyborgs break through the defensive line,

00:08:57.170 --> 00:09:00.640
they’ll have a straight path to the city and Surface HQ.

00:09:00.640 --> 00:09:07.400
Protecting the citizens and their property is the job of all operatives of the Bureau. We must not let them through.

00:09:07.400 --> 00:09:10.360
And if Ginga appears...

00:09:10.360 --> 00:09:12.180
...we make her a priority

00:09:12.180 --> 00:09:13.780
...and rescue her.

00:09:17.160 --> 00:09:18.680
Okay, let’s go!

00:09:18.680 --> 00:09:19.920
Go!

00:09:33.910 --> 00:09:38.210
Nove, Deed, Wendi, those four are heading toward you.

00:09:38.210 --> 00:09:39.580
Are you serious?

00:09:39.580 --> 00:09:40.430
Yes.

00:09:40.430 --> 00:09:43.380
But the situation’s different this time.

00:09:43.380 --> 00:09:45.590
They’re coming to fight us head on.

00:09:45.590 --> 00:09:46.510
What?

00:09:46.510 --> 00:09:47.980
Sounds good to me.

00:09:47.980 --> 00:09:51.700
We’ll take over Central Command
before the <i>Cradle</i> surfaces.

00:09:51.700 --> 00:09:53.690
I want to take out their command center.

00:09:53.690 --> 00:09:58.110
I want to take out as many unpredictable elements as possible.

00:10:12.070 --> 00:10:13.590
That girl.

00:10:16.330 --> 00:10:17.240
Fried!

00:10:20.510 --> 00:10:21.800
Caro!

00:10:24.270 --> 00:10:25.960
Change of plans!

00:10:25.960 --> 00:10:27.840
I’ll take this one out first.

00:10:27.840 --> 00:10:29.100
Right, Subaru?

00:10:29.100 --> 00:10:30.060
Right!

00:10:32.550 --> 00:10:33.550
<b>Wing...</b>

00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:35.670
Execute I.S.

00:10:36.390 --> 00:10:37.310
<b>Ray Storm</b>

00:10:52.490 --> 00:10:53.110
Tia!

00:11:00.040 --> 00:11:01.110
<b>Aerial Cannon</b>

00:11:05.060 --> 00:11:07.260
Subaru and Tia are...

00:11:07.260 --> 00:11:08.450
Let’s get back to them...

00:11:11.470 --> 00:11:13.040
<b>Wheel Protection</b>

00:11:16.340 --> 00:11:17.610
Tia!

00:11:19.970 --> 00:11:21.200
Tia!

00:11:24.680 --> 00:11:26.980
It’s dangerous to fight alone here.

00:11:26.980 --> 00:11:28.060
Let’s meet back up!

00:11:29.330 --> 00:11:33.000
Too bad, we’re not letting you get together!

00:11:54.970 --> 00:11:56.980
Ginny.

00:11:56.980 --> 00:11:59.680
I’ve trapped the illusionist.

00:11:59.680 --> 00:12:02.910
I’ll keep them apart while you fight.

00:12:02.910 --> 00:12:03.590
All righty!

00:12:04.200 --> 00:12:06.470
You too, Miss, if you please.

00:12:13.530 --> 00:12:16.630
How does it feel when you, a useless gunner,

00:12:16.630 --> 00:12:22.570
who’s half of what she is when she’s with that girl with the ribbon, finally gets separated from her group of four?

00:12:22.570 --> 00:12:27.990
I’ll make you taste Cinques’s pain
and suffering instead of the girl with the ribbon.

00:12:29.040 --> 00:12:31.140
I’m inside their barrier.

00:12:31.140 --> 00:12:36.150
Lightning and Subaru are both a good distance away
and in difficult fights themselves.

00:12:36.150 --> 00:12:40.690
If I show my back to them, it’ll be over in an instant.

00:12:41.760 --> 00:12:45.070
Lightning, Subaru, bit of a change of plans.

00:12:45.070 --> 00:12:49.240
There’s no need to force yourself
in defeating the enemy in front of you.

00:12:49.240 --> 00:12:52.410
Just hinder them and wear them down. That’s enough.

00:12:52.410 --> 00:12:56.210
We can protect the city and Central Command.

00:12:56.210 --> 00:12:57.570
Are you an idiot?

00:12:57.570 --> 00:12:59.700
It won’t take that much time.

00:12:59.700 --> 00:13:02.450
You’re not somebody we’re supposed to capture.

00:13:02.450 --> 00:13:04.910
Nobody will get mad if we kill you.

00:13:04.910 --> 00:13:06.930
They can hear us communicating?

00:13:06.930 --> 00:13:07.850
Transmission over!

00:13:10.260 --> 00:13:13.940
Everyone, concentrate on your fight!

00:13:29.410 --> 00:13:31.790
These are...

00:13:31.790 --> 00:13:33.800
Bases for human experiments?

00:13:33.800 --> 00:13:34.700
I think so.

00:13:35.830 --> 00:13:41.250
He plays with people’s lives and treats them as ingredients for experiments.

00:13:41.250 --> 00:13:45.720
This is the type of research he’s done.

00:13:45.720 --> 00:13:49.520
We need to stop him as soon as possible.

00:13:49.520 --> 00:13:50.150
Agreed.

00:13:56.210 --> 00:13:56.870
Sister!

00:14:06.780 --> 00:14:08.110
Sister?

00:14:09.020 --> 00:14:10.670
Enforcer Fate,

00:14:10.670 --> 00:14:13.040
I’m fine. It’s all right.

00:14:13.040 --> 00:14:16.210
I’ve caught a combat cyborg.

00:14:16.210 --> 00:14:20.130
As soon as I secure her, I’ll meet up with you.

00:14:21.710 --> 00:14:23.650
Roger.

00:14:29.370 --> 00:14:30.840
Miss Fate.

00:14:32.050 --> 00:14:35.850
Has the prodigal daughter returned,

00:14:35.850 --> 00:14:38.500
or does she yet rebel?

00:14:39.480 --> 00:14:41.440
Neither.

00:14:41.440 --> 00:14:43.760
I’m here to capture a criminal.

00:14:43.760 --> 00:14:44.860
That’s all.

00:14:52.960 --> 00:14:54.590
Giant Form

00:14:56.250 --> 00:14:58.020
Let’s go, Eisen!

00:14:58.020 --> 00:14:59.120
Roger.

00:15:01.240 --> 00:15:03.170
Flying Comet

00:15:10.990 --> 00:15:11.960
Vita.

00:15:11.960 --> 00:15:13.600
If you hit it too hard...

00:15:15.040 --> 00:15:16.520
Shut up!

00:15:16.520 --> 00:15:21.920
Letting the center and rear hold back
their most powerful magic is part of the front line’s job.

00:15:25.970 --> 00:15:29.350
Assault Team, Riot Force 6, Stars Squad.

00:15:29.350 --> 00:15:29.950
Here.

00:15:29.950 --> 00:15:33.870
We’ve found the routes to
the throne room and engine room.

00:15:34.860 --> 00:15:36.330
Totally different directions!

00:15:36.330 --> 00:15:39.310
Aren’t the Assault Team members here yet?

00:15:39.310 --> 00:15:42.280
We’re getting them from everywhere we can,

00:15:42.280 --> 00:15:44.740
but it’ll still take forty minutes.

00:15:44.740 --> 00:15:45.480
No way around it.

00:15:46.210 --> 00:15:50.040
Stars 1 and Stars 2 will split up.

00:15:50.040 --> 00:15:51.540
Roger that.

00:15:51.540 --> 00:15:53.660
We’ll get your support there as soon as we can.

00:15:53.660 --> 00:15:54.930
Vita!

00:15:54.930 --> 00:16:04.900
Stopping just one of the engine and Vivio
in the throne room may stop this, and it may not.

00:16:04.900 --> 00:16:08.340
And while we’re standing here,
things are getting worse outside.

00:16:08.340 --> 00:16:11.780
But you’ve expended so much energy, Vita.

00:16:11.780 --> 00:16:14.850
That’s why I’m going to the engine room.

00:16:14.850 --> 00:16:17.450
You go save Vivio.

00:16:17.450 --> 00:16:18.400
But.

00:16:18.400 --> 00:16:21.400
This is what Eisen and I are best at.

00:16:21.400 --> 00:16:22.870
You know that?

00:16:22.870 --> 00:16:25.040
Destroying and smashing.

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:32.590
There’s nothing in the worlds Vita, Knight of the Steel Hammer, and Graf Eisen, the Iron Count, cannot destroy.

00:16:36.370 --> 00:16:40.180
I’ll destroy it in a second and come to back you up.

00:16:40.180 --> 00:16:44.670
We’ll finish this and meet up with Hayate out front.

00:16:46.150 --> 00:16:47.560
Take care.

00:16:47.560 --> 00:16:49.600
Make sure you come meet me, okay?

00:16:49.600 --> 00:16:51.340
Of course!

00:16:53.490 --> 00:16:57.330
Riot Force 6, Stars 1 is heading toward the throne room.

00:16:57.330 --> 00:16:59.920
Stars 2 is heading toward the engine room.

00:17:01.810 --> 00:17:04.040
Nanoha. Vita.

00:17:14.700 --> 00:17:16.110
It was an illusion after all.

00:17:22.720 --> 00:17:28.520
You need to learn more than one trick,
Dumbass-with-Illusions!

00:17:43.950 --> 00:17:46.570
Her bullets are sharper than they were.

00:17:46.570 --> 00:17:50.450
One or two shots from that
spud cannon aren’t enough to hurt me.

00:17:50.450 --> 00:17:52.840
Well, that’s true.

00:17:52.840 --> 00:17:57.840
It’s all I can do to last against
these two in such an enclosed environment.

00:17:57.840 --> 00:18:02.290
Until the barrier-destruction staff come, I have to survive.

00:18:10.430 --> 00:18:12.320
Deed, you too?

00:18:12.320 --> 00:18:14.280
Otto’s orders.

00:18:14.280 --> 00:18:19.700
She said that if we don’t take out
that illusionist for sure, it’ll be a real problem.

00:18:21.300 --> 00:18:23.830
To think they’d hit my leg.

00:18:26.250 --> 00:18:30.710
Three combat cyborgs, plus the Gadgets.

00:18:33.210 --> 00:18:37.700
This is impossible, maybe.

00:18:38.290 --> 00:18:41.160
Don’t worry. I’m sure you can do it, Teana.

00:18:44.500 --> 00:18:47.580
You’re strong, Tia! I’m sure you’ll be okay.

00:18:50.670 --> 00:18:52.750
Let’s both do our best, Tia.

00:18:53.680 --> 00:18:59.760
Why? Why am I thinking of her even now?

00:19:01.350 --> 00:19:02.350
Let’s go.

00:19:03.770 --> 00:19:06.500
To make our dreams come true.

00:19:08.980 --> 00:19:10.100
<b>Shooting Ray</b>

00:19:16.160 --> 00:19:17.950
Why are you...

00:19:17.950 --> 00:19:19.840
Why are you doing this?

00:19:22.140 --> 00:19:26.310
What’s making you do this now, at a time like this?

00:19:26.310 --> 00:19:28.230
If you’re after something, tell us!

00:19:28.230 --> 00:19:32.690
If it’s nothing bad, we may be able to help you!

00:19:35.110 --> 00:19:36.170
Fried!

00:19:36.640 --> 00:19:37.590
Caro!

00:19:40.770 --> 00:19:41.540
Strada!

00:19:41.940 --> 00:19:43.020
Jet

00:20:02.840 --> 00:20:05.260
Sir, it’s them.

00:20:11.180 --> 00:20:13.400
Are you a knight of the Bureau?

00:20:13.400 --> 00:20:17.520
First Lieutenant Signum, with the Main Office’s Riot Force 6.

00:20:17.520 --> 00:20:23.120
Formerly of the Capital Defense Corps,
which means you have seniority over me.

00:20:23.120 --> 00:20:24.120
Is that so?

00:20:24.580 --> 00:20:28.190
Are you going to destroy Central Command?

00:20:28.190 --> 00:20:32.560
I’m just going to see my old friend, Regius.

00:20:32.560 --> 00:20:35.460
Is that for revenge?

00:20:35.460 --> 00:20:38.080
It’s not something that can be put into words.

00:20:38.080 --> 00:20:40.800
I’ll ask you to let me pass.

00:20:41.360 --> 00:20:45.470
If you don’t put it into words, I won’t allow you through.

00:20:48.720 --> 00:20:51.420
Agito, is something wrong?

00:20:51.420 --> 00:20:53.210
N-Nothing!

00:20:53.210 --> 00:20:57.840
Babbling isn’t how knights do things!

00:21:01.150 --> 00:21:06.760
Knights or not, this means we’re fighting for pride instead of talking!

00:21:07.620 --> 00:21:09.320
Shut up, cross midget!

00:21:09.320 --> 00:21:16.400
I, Agito the Sword Faerie, for justice and
my friend Zest, come forth with flames in my hand!

00:21:18.070 --> 00:21:26.590
I, Reinforce Zwei, the Wind of Blessing,
will stop you in the name of the Bureau!

00:21:27.420 --> 00:21:28.320
Here we go.

00:21:34.880 --> 00:21:36.350
Ginny.

00:21:42.340 --> 00:21:46.780
It’d hurt Ginny, so I won’t use Oscillating Breaker.

00:21:46.780 --> 00:21:53.620
What I’m after isn’t to destroy or wound her, but to knock her out with magical damage.

00:21:54.520 --> 00:21:59.080
I’ve never had a real fight with Ginny.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:04.490
But I’ll save you!

00:22:13.710 --> 00:22:17.350
I’m almost there.

00:22:17.350 --> 00:22:20.310
I’ve still got cartridges.

00:22:20.310 --> 00:22:21.890
I’m fine.

00:22:21.890 --> 00:22:22.800
It’ll be easy.

00:23:07.720 --> 00:23:12.970
So it was <i>your</i> kind who took out Nanoha back then?

00:23:15.910 --> 00:23:18.580
No more miss nice girl.

00:23:18.580 --> 00:23:20.650
Every single last one of you, I’ll...

00:23:20.650 --> 00:23:23.520
...destroy you all!

00:23:24.490 --> 00:23:26.040
The <i>Cradle</i> will reach

00:23:26.120 --> 00:23:26.540
orbit in

00:23:26.740 --> 00:23:26.870
2

00:23:26.870 --> 00:23:27.490
2 hours

00:23:28.160 --> 00:23:28.960
2 hours and 16 minutes

00:25:18.030 --> 00:25:21.620
The battles continue,
and soldiers get hurt.

00:25:21.620 --> 00:25:24.950
Pain that we face, and pain that we can’t.

00:25:24.950 --> 00:25:28.670
An unerasable past, and each of their scars.

00:25:34.880 --> 00:25:36.040
Take off!
